@dsh-fly/dsh-plugin-fly-skins README · Four palettes：Every palette has a light and a dark half. The choice persists in the profile's patch layer
(field `skin`), so it survives restarts and profile switches.

**四套配色各有明暗两半**，选择写进 profile 的 patch 层（`skin` 字段），重启和切换 profile 后保留。

